      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: Any clarification on if this can play nicely with the OSC tool you guys announced? It's unclear if that's baked in and only expecting webcam data, or if it'll be able to read any externally-wrapped OSC applications. Likewise, if it's baked in, are there any plans to allow for the updated Unity package script(s) provided by Vive?",
