      "mergeID": "60b566ea1ce9352da6b248b3",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Would be amazing if this had full support in VRC. It would add lots of immersion and be a great addition. Lots of people would buy it and it’d make the game even better! The nuanced facial movements you could make with your avatar would be so cool. Eye tracking is a highly demanded feature in new headsets. How long until facial tracking will be as well?",
