      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 2
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have a HTC face tracker and while it's normally a 60hz device it's limited to 4hz? using OSC in VRchat. I would love to see a native implementation. I also have more blendshapes then float parameters I can use so... honestly it's extremely bad in VRchat. OSC won't beat a native implementation.\nI use Neos regularly and I use my face tracker over there and it's very smooth and amazing and it's extremely hard to go back to VRchat's method of doing expressions.\nI would love to see a native implementation for this hardware.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
